{
  "criterion": "https://github.com/atomicdotdev/atomic/compare/dev...astrogilda:feat/criterion-evidence-replay?expand=1&title=feat%28intent%29%3A+replay+bounded+retained+evidence+with+native+freshness+pins&body=Atomic%27s+authoring+gate+checks+declared+verification+records%2C+but+the+CLI+has+no+optional+route+for+reviewers+to+replay+narrowly+defined+claims+from+retained+evidence.+This+adds+%60intent+validate+--replay-evidence+MANIFEST+--evidence-checker+PROGRAM%60%2C+plus+%60--json+--evidence-context%60+for+native+pins.+Ordinary+validation+remains+unchanged%2C+and+replay+never+marks+an+acceptance+criterion+met.%0A%0AThe+manifest+binds+the+native+criterion%2C+intent+substance+and+full+stored+source%2C+selected+view+and+ancestor+Merkle%2Fscope+chain%2C+case%2C+and+consumer+policy.+Atomic+explicitly+invokes+a+locally+selected+checker+without+a+shell%2C+enforces+time+and+input%2Foutput+limits%2C+admits+JSON+through+its+existing+byte+boundary%2C+and+rejects+unbound+responses.+Pins+are+checked+again+after+invocation.+Supported%2C+contradicted%2C+and+not-established+results+retain+their+scope%3B+missing%2C+unsupported%2C+stale%2C+malformed%2C+failed%2C+and+timed-out+evidence+cannot+pass.%0A%0AAn+optional+Python+recipe+uses+Probity+Verify%27s+four+existing+bounded+adapters.+For+example%2C+retaining+selected+passages+supports+a+source-coverage+claim%3B+changed+bytes+against+the+original+digest+are+unknown%2C+while+a+repinned+record+omitting+a+selected+passage+is+contradicted.+These+claims+do+not+establish+arbitrary+task+correctness+or+authenticate+a+witness.+Python+is+optional+and+the+core+dependency+is+unchanged.%0A%0AValidation%3A+native+signed-intent+CLI+integration%2C+six+replay+controls%2C+five+installed-checker+semantic+controls%2C+retained+native+CLI+source-coverage+controls%2C+existing+vault-context%2Fview-switch+tests%2C+and+strict+CLI%2Frepository+Clippy+checks+passed.+The+preceding+isolated+commit+repairs+two+existing+Clippy+findings+without+changing+helper+behavior.+The+committed+full+CLI+suite+passed+2038+tests%2C+with+results+retained+in+the+delivery+receipt.%0A",
  "dsse": "https://github.com/atomicdotdev/atomic/compare/dev...astrogilda:feat/provenance-dsse-export?expand=1&title=feat%28provenance%29%3A+add+optional+DSSE+export+and+pinned-key+verification&body=Atomic+can+already+hand+reviewers+a+native+PROV+projection%2C+but+a+DSSE-consuming+reviewer+has+no+portable+signed+export+or+pinned-key+reader.+This+adds+optional+%60dsse-export%60+support+to+%60provenance+show%60+and+%60trace+--json%60%2C+plus+an+offline+%60verify-dsse%60+command+that+emits+only+the+exact+authenticated+payload+bytes.%0A%0AThe+versioned+container+declares+exporter-only+coverage.+It+preserves+existing+projections+and+any+native+Data+Integrity+proofs%2C+and+reuses+Atomic+Ed25519+keys+through+DSSE+traits+with+its+default+backend+disabled.+Ordinary+output+and+native+hashes%2Fsignatures+stay+unchanged.+Export+signatures+do+not+establish+original+authorship%2C+authorized+action%2C+claim+truth%2C+complete+capture+or+verification+of+referenced+primaries.%0A%0AValidation+on+this+head+with+%60RUSTFLAGS%3D-Dwarnings%60%3A+169+canonical+tests+and+2+doctests%3B+6+real+CLI+provenance+tests+with+independent+Python+consumption+and+negative+controls%3B+5+existing+tests+with+the+feature+disabled%3B+exact+dedicated+feature+Clippy+command+and+formatting.+Feature+documentation+also+passed+with+Rustdoc+warnings+denied.+The+added+workflow+requires+the+feature+tests%2C+independent+Python+reader+and+strict+lint.+Two+small+shared+prerequisite+fixes+remove+existing+Clippy+warnings+in+the+workspace+directory+and+vault+context+helpers%3B+existing+workspace+CI+remains+unchanged.%0A",
  "native": "https://github.com/atomicdotdev/atomic/compare/dev...astrogilda:test/native-authority-recovery?expand=1&title=test%3A+retain+native+delegation+evaluation+with+an+installed+offline+consumer&body=A+locally+stored+delegation+can+look+valid+in+one+process+yet+behave+differently+when+the+next+process+reloads+its+certificate+or+revocation.+Four+native+integration+cases+exercise+twelve+fresh+child-process+lookups%3A+exact+retry+and+narrow+scope%3B+persisted+local+revocation+with+distinct+renewal%3B+expired%2C+altered+and+ambiguous+grants+with+valid+recovery%3B+and+externally+selected+issuer-key%2Fsubject+boundaries.%0A%0AThe+retained-run+wrapper+preserves+the+exact+executable%2C+source%2C+lockfile%2C+fixed+population+and+original+stdout%2Fstderr.+The+existing+cross-platform+cargo+matrix+runs+the+native+tests.+A+separate+Ubuntu+workflow+builds+and+installs+Observer+from+immutable+reviewed+source%2C+checks+a+fresh+packet+with+host-selected+source%2Flockfile%2Freader+pins+outside+the+packet%2C+and+retains+exact+positive+and+refusal+results.+The+offline+reader+never+executes+the+retained+binary.%0A%0AValidation+on+the+final+source%3A+170+canonical+tests+and+one+doctest%2C+strict+CLI%2Frepository+Clippy%2C+formatting+and+diff+checks+passed.+A+fresh+four-case+run+passed+through+the+installed+consumer.+Raw-log+mutation%2C+repinned+selection+widening+and+wrong+selection+digests+refused+for+their+exact+intended+reasons%3B+oversized+and+symlink+inputs+refused.+An+injected+build+failure+cannot+fabricate+a+passed+native+result.+The+small+isolated+prerequisite+repairs+two+existing+Clippy+findings+without+changing+helper+behavior.%0A%0ACoverage+is+local+certificate+selection+and+persistence+across+ordinary+reader-process+restarts.+Server+authorization%2C+remote+revocation%2C+crash-mid-write+recovery+and+independent+effect+custody+remain+unestablished.+These+local+results+do+not+establish+completed+upstream+CI%2C+maintainer+acceptance+or+recurring+outside+adoption.+The+publication%2C+database%2C+bridge%2C+hook-health%2C+remote-signing+and+corpus+implementations+remain+with+their+existing+owners.%0A"
}
